-- Seon-Pyeong (20091) beside the Grotto of Exile's entrance in Orc Valley:
-- a +9 weapon or body armour of level 65-66 made into its level-80 successor
-- in the cube window, with a Broszura Szermierki from the grotto, two of each
-- pearl and two million Yang. The recipes are cube.seon_pyeong.txt, appended
-- to the share's cube.txt (port/shareify.py); Cube_open refuses an NPC that has
-- no recipe there. NerrVoVy's quest and recipes (26-27 September), the text
-- without diacritics like the rest of ours, and a word on what the anvil keeps.
quest seon_pyeong begin
	state start begin
		when 20091.chat."Wytwarzanie Ekwipunku" begin
			say_title(mob_name(20091)..":")
			say("Witaj! Potrafie przekuc na wyzsze poziomy bron")
			say("oraz zbroje w legendarny, potezniejszy ekwipunek.")
			say("Czy przyniosles ze soba odpowiednie przedmioty,")
			say("ulepszacze oraz wystarczajaca ilosc Yang?")
			say("")
			say("Bonusy i kamienie oddanego przedmiotu przepadaja.")
			say("")
			local s = select("Otworz okno ulepszania", "Anuluj")
			if s == 1 then
				setskin(NOWINDOW)
				command("cube open")
			end
		end
	end
end
